PE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_COUNTER_SEATING"],"吧台座位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ3YcHCK0BKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ3IcHCKwBKA8",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS_TIPS"],"特殊餐點",null,null,"分享特殊餐點相關資訊","特殊餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ3IcHCK4BKBA",null,null,["涼拌洋蔥"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ3YcHCLABKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ3IcHCK8BKBE",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["藏味拉麵\n\n20250625中午11:27二訪\n開店前門口已登記八組候位。\n\n很久以前到訪過但沒留下評論，這次來溫習一下。\n\n第二輪11:57入座。12:19完食。\n\n店內共三味師傅，師傅都很注重衛生，口罩、手套、頭巾都戴好戴滿。座位區背後有衣架掛勾。\n\n魚介豚骨叉燒盛宴豚骨拉麵 330\n涼拌洋蔥 60\n\n日本味麵硬，拉麵配置豬梅花、豬五花、雞叉燒各兩片，加麵可選半碗一碗（一球/兩球）\n\n涼拌洋蔥冰鎮過，不嗆辣，清爽開胃。\n拉麵各項表現的確如其他評論提到的中規中矩。有些人或許會認為藏味稍嫌單調沒特色，我倒認為藏味的中規中矩是恰如其分。叉燒不算是特別重口味的叉燒，肥瘦厚薄生熟都剛剛好，湯頭確實濃郁但口味並不粘膩厚重，日本味也可以輕鬆喝完。麵條滑順也符合對拉麵的印象。雖然沒有讓人特別印象深刻的強項，不過整體表現不俗，想吃到夠水準的拉麵會來吃。\n之後願意再回訪嘗試清湯拉麵。\n\n———————-\n\n20250701週二中午三訪11:38第二輪，門口六人兩組候位。12:05入店。12:35完食。離開時門口還是很多組候位\n\n醬油叉燒盛宴雞骨拉麵320\n\n—————————\n20251204週四中午11:55晴，到店免排隊。\n這次才發現座位桌子下方有置物空間，很妙的設計。\n\n鹽味雞骨叉燒盛宴拉麵320\n\n是很家常的雞湯味，加麵半碗剛好。\n\n————————\n\n20251218中午12:10門口排了五位。12:31入店。後面還排了七八個人。12:55完食。加一碗兩球麵真的太飽了。這次才發現有洗手間。\n\n濃厚豚骨叉燒盛宴豚骨拉麵320\n五花肉60\n\n—————-\n\n藏味拉麵\n\n20260318週三天晴中午13:40到店，滿座，店外排一人。沒想到中午營業時間結束前還是滿滿的人。13:45最後一位入座，14:07完食，離開前店內還有兩位客人。\n\n加了半碗麵，藏味表現真的很穩定。湯麵料全吃完了，前半段也真的滿喜歡的，但後半段就有點膩了，我今年吃了幾家濃湯都有差不多的心得。這次吃了一向表現穩定的藏味濃湯，再次確認自己的口味轉變，可能今年要開始以清湯為主了。\n\n餐點：\n魚介豚骨叉燒盛宴豚骨拉麵330",null,[0,23]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12528766041847503037/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXUms5WGVGTmpWamwyWWpKc01GWkVhRTFoUXpGc1lrWkdVMVJzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12528766041847503037/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXUms5WGVGTmpWamwyWWpKc01GWkVhRTFoUXpGc1lrWkdVMVJzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12528766041847503037/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXUms5WGVGTmpWamwyWWpKc01GWkVhRTFoUXpGc1lrWkdVMVJzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12528766041847503037/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXUms5WGVGTmpWamwyWWpKc01GWkVhRTFoUXpGc1lrWkdVMVJzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12528766041847503037/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXUms5WGVGTmpWamwyWWpKc01GWkVhRTFoUXpGc1lrWkdVMVJzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12528766041847503037/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVXUms5WGVGTmpWamwyWWpKc01GWkVhRTFoUXpGc1lrWkdVMVJzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,19356,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WRk9XeFNjVjl2YjJsMFZEaE1hQzFsYkZGU1RsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf4bcf0c6b5a48a93!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnVFOWxScV9vb2l0VDhMaC1lbFFSTlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WRk9XeFNjVjl2YjJsMFZEaE1hQzFsYkZGU1RsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WRk9XeFNjVjl2YjJsMFZEaE1hQzFsYkZGU1RsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WRk9XeFNjVjl2YjJsMFZEaE1hQzFsYkZGU1RsRRILMGRpWkJhSnNZNWEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uVkZPV3hTY1Y5dmIybDBWRGhNYUMxbGJGRlNUbEUSCzBkaVpCYUpzWTVhIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARk4qktcbwvPQqCzBkaVpCYUpzWTVh\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQoykIsQEoEg"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjOlufJv9KWAxWfdF4EHU1zGF0Q0pMFCEwoAw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjmo9rJv9KWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ0pMFCJEBKAM"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGTE5IUkRPR2x0TTFSblZ6STVVbVl3VjBOMmEyYxAB",["0x0:0xf4bcf0c6b5a48a93",null,1766646105853180,1766646105853180,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/10167546